CinnabarIsland_Text_PokemonLabAccessDenied::
    .string "Access denied.\p"
    .string "A BOULDER KEY is required to enter\n"
    .string "the POKéMON LAB.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_PokemonLabAccessGranted::
    .string "Access granted using the\n"
    .string "BOULDER KEY.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_RivalMansion::
	.string "{RIVAL}: Hah!\n"
	.string "So you figured out the ferry after\l"
	.string "all.\p"
	.string "Don't get smug. I got here first.\p"
	.string "People on this island keep talking\n"
	.string "about that wrecked MANSION.\p"
	.string "It wasn't just some rich guy's old\n"
	.string "house. It was a lab.\p"
	.string "Something broke out of there.\n"
	.string "And someone powerful seems\l"
	.string "implicated.\p"
	.string "Powerful enough to chase it\n"
	.string "personally.\p"
	.string "Sounds important, so obviously I'm\n"
	.string "checking it before you do.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_BlaineLivedHereSinceBeforeLab::
    .string "CINNABAR GYM's BLAINE is quite the\n"
    .string "odd fellow.\p"
    .string "He has watched this island change\n"
    .string "from old lava rock into a place\l"
    .string "of invention.\p"
    .string "No wonder he talks so much about\n"
    .string "progress.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_ScientistsExperimentInMansion::
    .string "After each eruption, the volcano\n"
    .string "leaves new soil behind.\p"
    .string "Plants return stronger than before.\n"
    .string "Nature renews itself through fire.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_IslandSign::
    .string "CINNABAR ISLAND\n"
    .string "The Fiery Town of Burning Desire$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_PokemonLab::
    .string "POKéMON LAB$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_GymSign::
    .string "CINNABAR ISLAND POKéMON GYM\n"
    .string "LEADER: BLAINE\l"
    .string "The Hotheaded Quiz Master!$"

Text_ExplosionTeach::
    .string "Can you imagine?\n"
    .string "If this volcano were to erupt?\p"
    .string "The explosion would be the end of\n"
    .string "us. How terrifying is that?\p"
    .string "While we're terrified, would you\n"
    .string "like me to teach EXPLOSION?$"

Text_ExplosionDeclined::
    .string "Yeah, you're right.\n"
    .string "It is too terrifying.$"

Text_ExplosionWhichMon::
    .string "You're terribly brave!\p"
    .string "Which POKéMON should I teach\n"
    .string "EXPLOSION?$"

Text_ExplosionTaught::
    .string "Using EXPLOSION near a volcano…\p"
    .string "What a terrifying thrill!$"

    .string "There's a research site near\n"
    .string "CINNABAR VOLCANO.\p"
    .string "A friend invited me, so I'm on my\n"
    .string "way up there.\p"
    .string "How about it?\n"
    .string "Do you feel like coming with me?$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_AllRightLetsGo::
    .string "All right, then.\n"
    .string "Let's go!$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_IllBeWaitingInPokeCenter::
    .string "What, are you too busy?\p"
    .string "Well, all right.\n"
    .string "The boat hasn't arrived yet anyway.\p"
    .string "I'll be waiting at the POKéMON\n"
    .string "CENTER over there.\p"
    .string "Come see me when you're done with\n"
    .string "your business here.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_MyPalsBoatArrived::
    .string "Looks like my pal's ready,\n"
    .string "too.\p"
    .string "He came specially here to\n"
    .string "CINNABAR to pick me up.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_FerryNoLongerRuns::
    .string "Looks like the path isn't\n"
    .string "safe right now.$"

CinnabarIsland_Text_ThanksForYourCompany::
    .string "Hey, wasn't that a long trek?\p"
    .string "My buddy seemed to enjoy\n"
    .string "your company.\p"
    .string "All right, thanks for your company!$"
